  WholeCellGroupOpener->True, CellGroupingRules->{"SectionGrouping", 50},
  CellID->200000010],
Cell[BoxData["CoonsPatchQ[expr] is True for a valid patch object and False otherwise. It
          is not a pattern test on the Association alone: it requires the Type tag
          to read \"CoonsPatch\", the four edges to be four pure functions, the four
          corners to be four points, and Map to be present."], "Notes", CellID->200000011],
Cell[BoxData["It returns True or False and raises nothing, so it is safe to Map over a
          list of candidate objects."], "Notes", CellID->200000012]
}, Open]],
